hadiths[52]{hadithnumber,text}:
"527","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan se ek ya do din pahle roza rakh kar aage na badho, siwae us aadmi ke jo roza rakhta ho to woh use rakhe. Muttafaq alaih."
"528","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jo us din roza rakhe jis mein shak ho us ne Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki nafarmani ki. Aur ise Bukhari ne ta'liqan zikr kiya, aur Khamsa ne ise mausul kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"529","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab tum use dekho to roza rakho, aur jab tum use dekho to iftar karo; phir agar tum par badal ho jae to us ka andaza karo. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai: Phir agar tum par andhera ho jae to tees ka andaza karo. Aur Bukhari ke han hai: To ginti tees poori karo. Aur unhi ke han Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees mein hai: To Sha'ban ki ginti tees poori karo."
"530","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke logon ne chand dekhne ki koshish ki to main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar di ke main ne use dekha hai, to Aap ne roza rakha aur logon ko us ke roze ka hukm diya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"531","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main ne chand dekha hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin? Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain? Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: To logon mein elan kar do Aey Bilal! Ke kal roza rakhen. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha, aur Nasai ne is ke mursal hone ko tarjeeh di."
"532","[AI-translation] Umm al-Mu'minin Hazrat Hafsah (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Fajr se pahle roze ki niyyat na kare us ka roza nahin hai. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne is ke mauqoof hone ko tarjeeh di, aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne ise marfoo'an sahih kaha. Aur Daraqutni ke han hai: Us ka roza nahin jis ne use raat se farz na kiya."
"533","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din mere paas aae aur farmaya: Kya tumhare paas kuch hai? Ham ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To main is waqt rozedar hun. Phir hamare paas doosre din aae to ham ne kaha: Hamen hais hadiya kiya gaya hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe dikhao, main ne subah rozedar hote hue ki thi. Phir Aap ne khaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"534","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log hamesha khair mein rahenge jab tak iftar mein jaldi karen. Muttafaq alaih; aur Tirmidhi ke han Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Mere bandon mein mujhe sab se mahboob woh hai jo sab se jaldi iftar kare."
"535","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sehri karo kyunke sehri mein barkat hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"536","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman bin Amir Dabbi (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi iftar kare to khajur se iftar kare; phir agar na pae to pani se iftar kare kyunke woh pak hai. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"537","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wisal se mana farmaya, to Musalmanon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Phir Aap Ya Rasulullah wisal kyun farmate hain? Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kaun meri tarah hai? Beshak main raat guzarta hun jabke mera Rabb mujhe khilata aur pilata hai. Phir jab unhon ne wisal se rukne se inkar kiya to Aap ne unhen ek din phir ek din wisal karaya, phir unhon ne chand dekha to Aap ne farmaya: Agar chand moakhar hota to main tumhen ziyada deta, unhen saza dene wale ki tarah jab unhon ne rukne se inkar kiya. Muttafaq alaih."
"538","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo jhoot baat aur us par amal aur jahalat na chhore to Allah ko hajat nahin ke woh apna khana aur peena chhore. Ise Bukhari aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Abu Dawud ke hain."
"539","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bosa lete jabke rozedar hote, aur mubashirat farmate jabke rozedar hote, lekin Aap apni hajat par tum sab se ziyada qaboo rakhne wale the. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur ek riwayat mein izafa kiya: Ramazan mein."
"540","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae jabke Aap ehram wale the, aur pichhne lagwae jabke Aap rozedar the. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"541","[AI-translation] Hazrat Shaddad bin Aws (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Baqi' mein ek aadmi ke paas se guzre jabke woh Ramazan mein pichhne lagwa raha tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Pichhne lagane wale aur lagwane wale ka roza toot gaya. Ise Khamsa ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ahmad, Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"542","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke sab se pahle rozedar ke liye pichhne lagwana is liye napasand kiya gaya ke Ja'far bin Abi Talib ne pichhne lagwae jabke woh rozedar the, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke paas se guzre aur farmaya: Yeh dono iftar kar chuke. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne baad mein rozedar ke liye pichhne lagwane ki ruksat di, aur Anas rozedar hote hue pichhne lagwate the. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur ise qawi kaha."
"543","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ramazan mein surma lagaya jabke Aap rozedar the. Ise Ibn Majah ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya; Tirmidhi ne kaha: Is mein koi cheez sahih nahin hai."
"544","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhool jae jabke rozedar ho aur kha le ya pi le to apna roza poora kare, kyunke use Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur Hakim ke han hai: Jo Ramazan mein bhool kar iftar kare us par na qaza hai na kaffara. Aur yeh sahih hai."
"545","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jise qai ghalib aa jae us par qaza nahin, aur jo qai talab kare us par qaza hai. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad ne ise ma'lul kaha; aur Daraqutni ne ise qawi kaha."
"546","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fath ke saal Ramazan mein Makkah ki taraf nikle aur Kura' al-Ghamim tak rozedar rahe, aur logon ne roza rakha; phir Aap ne pani ka pyala mangwaya aur use uthaya yahan tak ke logon ne use dekha, phir piya. To Aap se us ke baad kaha gaya ke kuch logon ne roza rakha hai. Aap ne farmaya: Woh nafarman hain, woh nafarman hain. Aur ek lafz mein hai ke Aap se kaha gaya ke logon par roza mashaqqat wala ho gaya hai aur woh sirf Aap ke fe'l ka intezar karte hain, to Aap ne Asr ke baad pani ka pyala mangwaya aur piya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"547","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hamzah bin Amr Aslami (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main safar mein roza rakhne ki quwwat pata hun, to kya mujh par gunah hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh Allah ki taraf se ruksat hai; to jo use le woh achcha hai, aur jo roza rakhna chahe us par gunah nahin hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Muttafaq mein Aishah ki hadees se hai ke Hamzah bin Amr ne poocha tha."
"548","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke bade buddhe ko ruksat di gayi ke iftar kare aur har din ke badle miskeen ko khana khilae, aur us par qaza nahin hai. Ise Daraqutni aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya aur donon ne ise sahih kaha."
"549","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main halak ho gaya Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Tumhen kis ne halak kiya? Us ne kaha: Main Ramazan mein apni biwi se mil betha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum pate ho jo gardan aazad karo? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To kya tum taqat rakhte ho ke do mahine musalsal roze rakho? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To kya tum pate ho jo saath miskeenon ko khana khilao? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Phir woh baith gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas khajur ka tokra laya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ise sadqa karo. To us ne kaha: Kya ham se ziyada faqeer par? To donon kinaron ke darmiyan ham se ziyada us ka mohtaj koi ghar nahin hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hanse yahan tak ke Aap ki dadhen zahir huin, phir farmaya: Jao aur use apne ghar walon ko khilao. Ise Sab'a ne riwayat kiya, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"550","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah aur Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jima' se junubi hote hue subah farmate, phir ghusl farmate aur roza rakhte. Muttafaq alaih; Muslim ne Umm Salamah ki hadees mein izafa kiya: Aur qaza na karte."
"551","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mar jae jabke us par roze hon to us ka wali us ki taraf se roze rakhe. Muttafaq alaih."
"552","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Arafah ke din ke roze ke bare mein poocha gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Woh guzre aur bache hue saal ka kaffara hai. Aur Aashura ke din ke roze ke bare mein poocha gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Woh guzre saal ka kaffara hai. Aur Peer ke din ke roze ke bare mein poocha gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Woh din hai jis mein main paida hua, aur jis mein mab'oos hua ya mujh par nazil hua. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"553","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan ke roze rakhe phir us ke baad Shawwal ke chhe milae woh zamane ke roze jaisa hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"554","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi banda Allah ke raste mein ek din roza rakhe Allah us din se us ke chehre se aag ko sattar saal door kar deta hai. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"555","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) roze rakhte yahan tak ke ham kehte ke iftar na karenge, aur iftar karte yahan tak ke ham kehte ke roza na rakhenge; aur main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kisi mahine ke poore roze rakhte kabhi nahin dekha siwae Ramazan ke, aur main ne Aap ko kisi mahine mein Sha'ban se ziyada roze rakhte nahin dekha. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"556","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke mahine mein teen din roze rakhen: terah, chaudah aur pandrah. Ise Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"557","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat ke liye halal nahin ke roza rakhe jabke us ka shauhar hazir ho siwae us ki ijazat ke. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Abu Dawud ne izafa kiya: Ramazan ke siwa."
"558","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do dinon ke roze se mana farmaya: Fitr ke din aur Qurbani ke din. Muttafaq alaih."
"559","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nubaishah Huzali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tashreeq ke din khane peene aur Allah Azza wa Jalla ke zikr ke din hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"560","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah aur Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke Tashreeq ke dinon mein roze rakhne ki ruksat na di gayi siwae us ke liye jo hadi na pae. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"561","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Juma ki raat ko raaton mein qiyam ke liye khaas na karo, aur Juma ke din ko dinon mein roze ke liye khaas na karo, siwae is ke ke woh us roze mein ho jo tum mein se koi rakhta ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"562","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi Juma ke din roza na rakhe siwae is ke ke us se pahle ek din roza rakhe ya us ke baad ek din. Muttafaq alaih."
"563","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Sha'ban aadha ho jae to roza na rakho. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Ahmad ne ise munkar kaha."
"564","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samma bint Busr (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hafta ke din roza na rakho siwae us ke jo tum par farz kiya gaya hai; phir agar tum mein se koi siwae angoor ki chhaal ya darakht ki lakdi ke na pae to use chabae. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain magar yeh muztarib hai; aur Malik ne is ka inkar kiya; aur Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yeh mansookh hai."
"565","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dinon mein sab se ziyada Hafta aur Itwar ka roza rakhte the, aur farmate the: Beshak yeh donon mushrikon ke eid ke din hain, aur main chahta hun ke un ki mukhalifat karun. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha, aur yeh unhi ke alfaz hain."
"566","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Arafah mein Arafah ke din ke roze se mana farmaya. Ise Khamsa ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha, aur Uqaili ne ise munkar kaha."
"567","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne roza na rakha jis ne hamesha roza rakha. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han Abu Qatadah se is lafz se hai: Na us ne roza rakha na iftar kiya."
"568","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan mein iman aur sawab ki niyyat se qiyam kare us ke guzre gunah bakhsh diye jaenge. Muttafaq alaih."
"569","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ashrah dakhil hota [yani Ramazan ka aakhri ashrah] to tahband mazboot bandhte, apni raat zinda rakhte aur apne ghar walon ko jagate. Muttafaq alaih."
"570","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramazan ke aakhri ashrah ka e'tikaf farmate yahan tak ke Allah ne Aap ko wafat di, phir Aap ke baad Aap ki biwiyon ne e'tikaf kiya. Muttafaq alaih."
"571","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab e'tikaf ka irada farmate to Fajr padhte phir apne e'tikaf ki jagah dakhil hote. Muttafaq alaih."
"572","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apna sar meri taraf dakhil farmate jabke Aap masjid mein hote to main use sanwarti; aur Aap ghar mein dakhil na hote siwae hajat ke jab Aap mo'takif hote. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"573","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke mo'takif par sunnat hai ke beemar ki iyadat na kare, janaze mein hazir na ho, aurat ko na chhue na mubashirat kare, hajat ke liye na nikle siwae us ke jis se bachna mumkin na ho, aur e'tikaf roze ke baghair nahin, aur e'tikaf jama' masjid ke siwa nahin hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal mein harj nahin, magar rajeh is ke aakhir ka mauqoof hona hai."
"574","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mo'takif par roza nahin siwae is ke ke use apne nafs par lazim kare. Ise Daraqutni aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya, aur rajeh is ka mauqoof hona bhi hai."
"575","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se kuch aadmiyon ko Lailat al-Qadr khwab mein aakhri saat mein dikhai gayi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main dekhta hun ke tumhare khwab aakhri saat mein mutabiq ho gae hain; to jo use talash karne wala ho woh use aakhri saat mein talash kare. Muttafaq alaih."
"576","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Lailat al-Qadr ke bare mein riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Sattaiswin raat hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur rajeh is ka mauqoof hona hai; aur is ke ta'ayyun mein chalis aqwal par ikhtilaf hua hai jo main ne Fath al-Bari mein zikr kiye hain."
"577","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Batayen agar main jan lun ke Lailat al-Qadr kaun si raat hai to us mein kya kahun? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah! Beshak Tu mu'af farmane wala hai, mu'afi ko pasand karta hai to mujhe mu'af farma. Ise Khamsa ne Abu Dawud ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"578","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sawariyan siwae teen masajid ke kasi na jaen: Masjid Haram, meri yeh masjid aur Masjid Aqsa. Muttafaq alaih."
